title: Socialist International 
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: lsi_timer <= 0 and lsi_founded == 1
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; lsi_timer += 13;
card-image: img/Labour_and_Socialist_International_logo.png



= Labour and Socialist International

We are an important part of the current Socialist International. We can try out a few things. 


- @increase_founding: Put party resources into the International
- @colonial_stance: Work towards a clear position on Colonialism
- @comintern_relation: Improve relations with the Comintern
- @fourth_relation: Improve relation with the Trotskyist Fourth International
- @send_funds: Fund parties



@increase_founding
subtitle: This organ is severly underfounded compared to the ammount of it's membership. (-1 resource)
on-arrival: resources-= 1; lsi_founding += 1

We are still laking behind the Comintern's resources founded by the Soviet Union.


@colonial_stance
subtitle: Our organisation can't agitate coherently on the colonial question.
view-if: not uk_colonial_adopted and not austria_colonial_adopted

- @british: Support the British position
- @austrian: Support the Austrian position
- @french: Support the French position
- @adopt_uk: Adopt the British position
- @adopt_austria: Adopt the Austrian position


@british
subtitle: The colonial administration should be reformed but it is not sensible to give them independence (in the near future).
on-arrival: uk_relation += 2; bad_colonial += 1; good_colonial -= 1

@french
subtitle: What position?
on-arrival: france_relation += 1; bad_colonial -= 1; good_colonial -= 1

@austrian
subtitle: Colonies should be abolished, self-determination for all.
on-arrival: austria_relation += 1; bad_colonial -= 1; good_colonial += 1; sweden_relation += 1; norway_relation += 1

@adopt_uk
subtitle: Colonial reform will be the way.
view-if: bad_colonial >= 2
on-arrival: uk_colonial_adopted = 1

@adopt_austria
subtitle: Colonies should be abolished altogether.
view-if: good_colonial >= 2
on-arrival: austria_colonial_adopted = 1

@comintern_relation
subtitle: We should not be rivals, we have more in common than we want to admit.
on-arrival: soviet_relation += 1; kpd_relation += 2; comintern_relation += 1


@fourth_relation
subtitle: They aren't that influential.
on-arrival: comintern_relation -= 0.2


@send_funds
subtitle: Use LSI resources to support member parties.

- @sfio: Support <span style="color: #ff0000;">**SFIO**</span> in France
- @sdapo: Support <span style="color: #cc0000;">**SDAPÖ**</span> in Austria
- @psi: Support <span style="color: #fc0000;">**PSI**</span> in Italy
- @psu: Support <span style="color: #c10000;">**PSU**</span> in Italy
- @spd: Support <span style="color: [+ spd_colour +];">**SPD**</span> in Germany
- @uspd: Support <span style="color: [+ uspd_colour +];">**USPD**</span> in Germany
 
@sfio
choose-if: gfdgdgdfsdgrgs == 23

@sdapo
choose-if: gfdgdgdfsdgrgs == 23

@psi
choose-if: gfdgdgdfsdgrgs == 23

@psu
choose-if: gfdgdgdfsdgrgs == 23

@spd
choose-if: lsi_founding >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: We are broke.
on-arrival: lsi_founding -= 1; resources += 1; austria_relation -= 3; france_relation -= 4; belgium_relation -= 3; uspd_relation -= 5

We have taken some money from the LSI - the other parties are displeased.

 @uspd
choose-if: lsi_founding >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: We are broke.
on-arrival: lsi_founding -= 1; workers_uspd += 3; unemployed_uspd += 4; new_middle_uspd += 1

We have funded the <span style="color: [+ uspd_colour +];">**USPD**</span>. For some reason. OK...















